---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updated = 'July 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy policy — Mahere Projects"
  description="How Mahere Projects Ltd collects, uses and protects the information you share through this website."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--rule">Privacy</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated {updated}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This website is operated by Mahere Projects Ltd, a project management
        consultancy based in Dunedin, New Zealand. This policy explains how we
        handle the personal information you choose to share with us.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        We only collect the information you provide when you contact us — such as
        your name, organisation, email address and the details of your enquiry.
        We do not require you to create an account, and we do not run tracking or
        advertising cookies on this site.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use your information solely to respond to your enquiry and to discuss
        how we might help with your project. Enquiries submitted through our
        contact form are delivered to us by email.
      </p>

      <h2>Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        Mahere will not on-sell or share your contact details. We do not trade,
        rent or sell personal information to third parties. Information is shared
        only where necessary to respond to you, or where we are required to do so
        by law.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We keep enquiry correspondence for as long as needed to assist you and to
        meet our ordinary business and legal obligations, after which it is
        deleted.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under the Privacy Act 2020 you may ask to see the personal information we
        hold about you and request that we correct it. To make a request, or if
        you have any questions about this policy, please
        <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
